title: "Agent-Slate"
abstract: "Agent-Slate is a maintained fork of Slate: a desktop prompt studio for AI filmmaking (plan shots, keep continuity, compile prompts) plus a Rust film-factory engine (MCP + ComfyUI packs). Windows, macOS, and Linux. Brains: Grok Build, Cursor Composer, Codex, or local."
